            <span class="text-white tracking-tight">akanksha<span class="text-(--color-teal)">.dev</span></span>
          </a>
          <p class="text-(--color-text-secondary) text-sm max-w-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Production AI Engineer at Samsung SDS. Architecting enterprise Agentic RAG, autonomous agents (Google ADK), and LLM orchestration.
          </p>
